{"time": 1772353448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2005677997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1084084150", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”沉默了一会之后摇了摇头，转过去小声和矢吹绫说“今天缺席的只有神山同学和历史老师……记住这个，明白了吗？”"}
{"time": 1772353477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1049056261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1084084150", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“哦……哦，好的”"}
